WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.474
YASREF will change the salary merit and

00:00:04.494 --> 00:00:06.201
promotion effectiveness update

00:00:06.221 --> 00:00:07.467
from JANUARY to APRIL,

00:00:07.487 --> 00:00:08.848
changing only the timing

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:11.620
in alignment with market best practices.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.668
Here's the new proposed cycle.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.785
The bonus will be paid in MARCH.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.737
In APRIL, merit increases and

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.413
promotion action will be reflected.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.101
During the transition year,

00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:31.025
this transition applies to the

00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:33.419
2027 IMPLEMENTATION YEAR only.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.495
For leave balance, you will receive

00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:38.789
a three-month balance in JANUARY.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.353
And from APRIL 2027,

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.331
a new annual balance begins,

00:00:42.351 --> 00:00:44.779
based on the updated grades.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.508
And the same will applied on the

00:00:48.528 --> 00:00:50.785
vacation allowance where the basic salary

00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:52.563
paid for 3 months and from April

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:54.922
will reflect the new basic salary.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.841
Comes to the merit, it will cover 15 months,

00:00:59.861 --> 00:01:02.168
while the percentage itself does not change

00:01:02.188 --> 00:01:03.612
— only the months.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.515
For further clarification,

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:10.516
contact HR personnel.
